            </note>
            <note corresp="#d23-f2" n="2" xml:id="d23-f2-content">
                <p>Soviet Ambassador Dobrynin and Secretary
                    of State Rogers discussed the U.S.
                    proposal for joint action in the ratification of the NPT.</p>
            </note>
